WEBVTT

00:19:27.782 --> 00:19:30.322
You walk into a grocery store
and there's a nice lady.

00:19:30.322 --> 00:19:33.793
She's got a table and on the table,
she has six jams,

00:19:33.793 --> 00:19:37.172
and you come over try the jams
to have a sample, buy some jam.

00:19:37.172 --> 00:19:40.991
Six jams; about 30 people
who would go by pick a jam,

00:19:40.991 --> 00:19:42.504
or stop and test something,

00:19:42.504 --> 00:19:45.621
and about a third
of those actually buy a jam.

00:19:46.262 --> 00:19:47.432
That's the baseline.

00:19:47.432 --> 00:19:49.970
Next week, you walk in, 24 jams:

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:55.282
jalapeño, strawberry, banana,
whatever; all sorts of jams.

00:19:55.282 --> 00:19:56.532
Well, guess what happens?

00:19:56.532 --> 00:19:58.882
Twice as many people stop,
look at all these jams,

00:19:58.882 --> 00:20:00.470
it's so interesting.